(
    title: "Double Dragon",
    developer: Some("Dan Kitchen"),
    description: Some("Activision\'s 1989 brawler port, arriving as the 2600 wound down: Billy fights through the Black Warriors\' turf with punches, kicks and elbows to bring Marian home. It sold nearly half a million carts late in the console\'s life — and earned a reputation as one of the hardest games on the system, a difficulty period reviewers called beyond anything else on the 2600."),
